Overview

EaseFlow is a modern task and project management dashboard designed to help teams organize, track, and manage their work efficiently. The application provides an interactive Kanban-style board where users can create tasks, move them between different stages, assign priorities, set due dates, and collaborate through comments.
The project focuses on improving workflow management by offering a clean and user-friendly interface with real-time task organization features similar to tools like Trello and Jira.

Key Features
User Authentication (Login & Signup)
Interactive Drag-and-Drop Task Board
Task Status Management (To Do, In Progress, Done)
Create, Update, and Delete Tasks
Task Priority and Due Date System
Team Member Management
Task Comments and Activity Tracking
Responsive and Modern UI
Secure Backend API Integration

Technologies Used
Frontend
React.js
React Router
Axios
Inline CSS Styling

Backend
Node.js
Express.js
Database
MongoDB

Purpose of the Project
The main objective of this project is to simplify project tracking and team collaboration through an intuitive dashboard interface. It demonstrates full-stack web development concepts including frontend design, backend API development, authentication, database integration, and state management.
